  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals who are either unaware of or deliberately ignore the historical atrocities of the Holocaust, and who may be drawn to provocative, ironic, or dark humor that trivializes genocide. The meme is designed to shock and provoke outrage, likely targeting those who enjoy or are attracted to hate speech, historical revisionism, or dark humor that mocks victims. It may also be aimed at communities that engage with or spread antisemitic content, as it directly invokes Hitler and Mengele and trivializes the Holocaust, which is a core antisemitic trope. The audience is likely to be online users who consume and share memes that are intentionally offensive, often to provoke strong reactions or to signal belonging to a subculture that embraces shock value and hate speech.",
